Metavariable P:Statement

Rule (Idempotence)
  Premise 
    P
  Conclusion 
    P ∨ P
  Proof
    P ∨ P by DisjunctionLeftIntroduction

Rule (NegatedDikjunctionIdempotence)
  Premise 
    ¬P
  Conclusion 
    ¬(P ∨ P)
  Proof
    Suppose
      P ∨ P
    Then
      P by TrivialDisjunctionElimiation
    Suppose
      P ∨ P
    Then
      ¬P
  Therefore 
    ¬(P ∨ P) by NegationIntroduction

Rule (NegatedConjunctionIdempotence)
  Premise 
    ¬P
  Conclusion 
    ¬(P ∧ P)
  Proof
    Suppose
      P ∧ P
    Then
      P by TrivialConjunctionElimiation
    Suppose
      P ∧ P
    Then
      ¬P
  Therefore 
    ¬(P ∧ P) by NegationIntroduction
